IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0024.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY PEN0024C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==AC==.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    *> A=ACTIVE S=SUSPENDED C=COLLECTIONS
    05 ACCOUNT-STAT       PIC X VALUE 'A'.
    05 LATE-CHARGE        PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM REPEAT-OFFENDER
    PERFORM COLLECTIONS-CHECK
    DISPLAY "ACCOUNT-STAT=" ACCOUNT-STAT
    DISPLAY "LATE-CHARGE=" LATE-CHARGE
    STOP RUN.
REPEAT-OFFENDER.
    IF AC-LATE-PMTS-YR >= 3 AND AC-DAYS-LATE > 30
        MOVE 'S' TO ACCOUNT-STAT
        ADD 50 TO LATE-CHARGE
    END-IF.
COLLECTIONS-CHECK.
    *> COLLECTIONS REFERRAL
    IF AC-DAYS-LATE > 60
        MOVE 'C' TO ACCOUNT-STAT
    END-IF.
